flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[New job submissions]
    B --> C[Assess current worker load & capacity]
    C --> D[Retrieve per-job resource history]
    D --> E[Predict resource impact of each job]
    E --> F[Select job with best cluster-fit]
    F --> G{Capacity available?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Assign to best-suited worker]
    G -->|No| I[Fallback: select by submission order]
    H --> J([End])
    I --> J
